  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Sulfates SLS &amp; SLES</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is:  </b>A gentle, conditioning, cleansing oil and micellar water hybrid makeup remover that melts off and lifts away long-wearing and waterproof makeup without tugging skin.<br><br><b>Skin Type:</b> Normal, Dry, Combination, and Oily <br><br><b>Formulation:</b> Liquid<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients:<br></b>- Comfrey Root Extract: Soothes dry, stressed skin. <br>- Micellar Water: Attracts dirt, oil, and makeup like a magnet.  <br>- Pro-Vitamin B5: A powerful, natural moisturizer.  <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Shake before use to blend the cleansing oil and micellar water. <br>-Squeeze onto cotton pad until product is fully absorbed. <br>-Press the saturated cotton pad onto eyes to melt makeup before gently wiping away.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Comfrey Root Extract: Soothes dry, stressed skin. <br>-Micellar Water: Attracts dirt, oil, and makeup like a magnet. <br>-Pro-Vitamin B5: A powerful, natural moisturizer.<br><br>Water/Aqua/Eau, Isohexadecane, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Panthenol, Glycerin, PPG-26-Buteth-26, Symphytum Officinale Root Extract, Sodium Benzoate, Disodium EDTA, Citric Acid, Sodium Chloride.<br><br></div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Vegan</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Sulfates SLS &amp; SLES</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is:  </b>A gentle, conditioning, cleansing oil and micellar water hybrid makeup remover that melts off and lifts away long-wearing and waterproof makeup without tugging skin.<br><br><b>Skin Type:</b> Normal, Dry, Combination, and Oily <br><br><b>Formulation:</b> Liquid<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients:<br></b>- Comfrey Root Extract: Soothes dry, stressed skin. <br>- Micellar Water: Attracts dirt, oil, and makeup like a magnet.  <br>- Pro-Vitamin B5: A powerful, natural moisturizer.  <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Shake before use to blend the cleansing oil and micellar water. <br>-Squeeze onto cotton pad until product is fully absorbed. <br>-Press the saturated cotton pad onto eyes to melt makeup before gently wiping away.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Comfrey Root Extract: Soothes dry, stressed skin. <br>-Micellar Water: Attracts dirt, oil, and makeup like a magnet. <br>-Pro-Vitamin B5: A powerful, natural moisturizer.<br><br>Water/Aqua/Eau, Isohexadecane, PEG-40 Hydrogenated Castor Oil, Panthenol, Glycerin, PPG-26-Buteth-26, Symphytum Officinale Root Extract, Sodium Benzoate, Disodium EDTA, Citric Acid, Sodium Chloride.<br><br></div></details>",
